  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_st01",
  "title": "客将至",
  "storyCode": "IW-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "db01cff2a7b6e11a8fdd2841e1e993ca69bbfe2c9f74e262916d82d9f2737f1b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "纯1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g01_yanstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "清晨时分，多云天气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大炎尚蜀，应峰路，有一家客栈。\n大炎如今，还叫客栈的店，多也不多。\n不过这里古色古香，好酒好茶，有尚蜀最好的风情在。\n红色的牌匾，金色的字。\n“行裕”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜模样的人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "湖松酒十坛，云辽酒三坛，归行老酒六坛......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜模样的人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刘二，你这儿的业绩，怎么比渡口那边少了这么多？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这您不能怪我啊，渡口那儿月初不知怎么的，热热闹闹地办了好几次宴，卖得比咱们这好不是理所当然的吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜模样的人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摆几次席，能差多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哟喂，您别站着说话不腰疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您那几天不在尚蜀，是不知道那排场有多夸张......说那是开张吃半年，一点都不过分啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说了，前几个月分明是咱们业绩更好，就这两天翻了船。郑大掌柜，您可不能拉偏架啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要知道咱们这家门店，可是最早做起来，最早做火的。其他店铺——要我说啊——见着咱都得喊一声老汉儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您可不能搞隔代亲，有了孙子忘了儿啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哭丧什么，谁是你老汉儿？我还什么都没说呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真等您说出口，那不就全完喽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是运气不好，没碰上那几个贵人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那怎么不见你运气好一回？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉！贵人贵人，哪来这么多贵人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咱们一直都靠的老主顾捧场，广告也不肯打，哪怕请几个漂亮姑娘帅小伙也好啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（瞪）......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我啥也没说。刚才那是在放屁呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "开酒楼客栈，凭的是贵人，靠的是关系，这话是不假。可你又怎么知道谁是贵人，谁不是呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要是什么都懂，我也当掌柜啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好好学着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有钱有势有牌面的爷，是个明眼人都看得出来，哪轮得到你这不开窍的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走江湖也好，在城里安家立业也好，只要人活着，少不了和别人打交道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要打交道，就少不得一双眼。识人，识事，咱们才有今天的好日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整天办灯儿，打烊就去麻将馆，你能有什么出息......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......咋不骂了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没见门前有俩客人吗！还不快去迎客！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哟......我还真没看见，快快，里边请！本日头两位客人，送盐花生两碟，菊花茶一壶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们似乎运气不错？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......时间赶早，就当我先替梁大人，为您接风洗尘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位先坐，茶水一会儿就到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为我们会直奔着梁府去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你那位“朋友”，好歹是一方父母官，忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忙到怠慢朋友，看来是真忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（大掌柜大掌柜，那您瞧着，这两个人算不算贵人？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少问多看，人不可貌相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g02_yanalley_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g05_mountaincity_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......慢着，土木天师是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人有所不知，大炎设有不止一处天师府，天下学子但凡源石技艺小有所成，都可以报考加入，经过层层考校，为国效力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石技艺的应用方向有很多种，源石科学也是蓬勃发展，大炎天师自然也需要分门别类，此所谓术业有专攻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为这种酷酷的称呼，都是指惊蛰小姐那样能征善战的施术者来着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惊蛰小姐就是恩人之前提过的罗德岛的那位炎国大官？哎呀，其实很久以前确是如此，只不过时代变化，民生大过天嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石技术造福民众，而对源石技艺与源石工程研究投入毕生心血的，就是大炎工部与各处天师府了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把山挪到移动城市上啊......放在其他国家，这种事情肯定无法想象......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是。不过虽说山水有情，但要真是劳民伤财，倒也不至于折腾这么大阵仗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主要还是有些土木天师对家乡心心念念，呕心沥血，非说什么移山小事一桩，不能舍山庄村落于不顾，硬摁着当地官员答应了下来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炎国有句老话，一方水土养一方人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜我在源石技艺方面实在是捉襟见肘，不然如果我是那些建造移动城市的人，我也会是同样的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们大炎人都是这样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为眼前有如此江山——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "风光无限。早春听雪，别有韵味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果恩人自小生活在这里，兴许也会有这种想法吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......确实说不定呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——真清爽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“尚蜀风高，拨云弄月”，确实是名副其实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尚蜀地界有“三山十七峰”的美景，来旅游的人还挺多的，还会有一些外国贵族特地前来瞻仰呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，想必还是因为寻常百姓在这大地上跋山涉水太困难了，不然这些名胜古迹，怕是早就人满为患咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好舒服的风。我本来还担心今天下雨，耽搁我们走山路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人说的是。春风拂面，细雨纷来，润物无声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前我就想问了，你不是个练武的吗？哪来这么多文绉绉的用词？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "习武可不耽搁学文化，师父常这么教训。习武是传统，学文也是传统，好好学习，是现代人的义务......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......再说，话术也是挣钱的门道嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，要不要顺道游览一番最近的山头？听说这两年，山里的人也多起来了，热闹得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不了吧，我们进城休整一两天，等到那姐妹俩与我们会合，就得继续赶路了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，不过我还是第一次有这种可惜了沿途风景的心情呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人向来专心致志，只向目标，心无二物，说明恩人工作认真，没有丝毫懈怠呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没有丝毫懈怠......我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种好话可以多说点喔，我不会当真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，恩人，不过是带我去办事处入职罢了，这点小事，犯不着那么急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也听炎熔恩人说了，您这趟远游，本来也有放假散心的心思，那就更没必要耽误恩人游山玩水，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是小炎熔也在就好了......需要整理思绪的，也不止我一个人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炎熔恩人只是突然受了委托，走另一条路而已，想必沿途风景，也是看得到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可不觉得小炎熔会是那种停下脚步来欣赏风景的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，炎熔恩人一直如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......其实以前，她不是现在这样，当然我也不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......恩人不必介怀，事在变，人在变，世事无常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们还是早些赶路吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g01_yanstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜小姐，人找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "错不了，从争山渡进城，已经到了未长区应峰路，安排了信得过的人，一路跟着呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙门人，随身带了只古董匣子，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，看得一清二楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出了岔子，你们可是要担责的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大小姐交代的事，出不了岔子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我们就替那些胆小怕事的老家伙们，去会一会这个江洋大盗！"
    },
